: These can range from custom conversation providers to workflow actions and triggers.</li></ul><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009860611/original/mTUQW6qsSZYl8RAEbdjEAsro-n2CgRRQjga267.png?1697037325\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155009860611\"></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Resources: Contains links to the app provider\u2019s website.<br><br>** Note: Support for third-party apps is provided by their respective developers.</li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Installing-&amp;-Uninstalling-Apps\"><br><strong>Installing &amp; Uninstalling Apps</strong></h2><p><br></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-Install-an-App&nbsp;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">How to Install an App&nbsp;</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\">1. On the app details page, click Install in the top-right corner.</p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009861541/original/k328OzLBuWvNwd2sCYArIzqdJ2bytlY91g8d16.png?1697037681\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155009861541\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br>2. Revisit the app's information and, if content, click \u2018Allow &amp; Install\u2019.<br><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009861598/original/0j8EcBeTnbPz9aYxUrz6acv6P9RD2fFakw4a35.png?1697037706\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155009861598\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br>3. Follow the subsequent steps in the provider\u2019s connection flow. This might involve logging into the app account and granting necessary permissions.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br>4. Post successful installation, any additional features/plugins bundled with the app will be integrated into the sub-account. These plugins/features can include:<br><br>- Custom conversation providers<br>- Workflow action or triggers<br><br>** Note: Installed apps are accessible under the 'Installed' tab.<br><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009861867/original/ayRLLi0kL2sCWhTWeI7ynPB0JnN6MhOZUg6fcd.png?1697037816\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155009861867\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Install-a-Paid-App\"><br><strong dir=\"ltr\">Install a Paid App</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\">Certain apps can be paid in nature. Depending upon the payment preference selected by the app provider (within the platform or External payment page), the payment will be processed during the installation process.</p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">On the app details page, click Install in the top-right corner.</span></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Revisit the app's information and pricing details, if content, click \u2018Allow &amp; Install\u2019.</span></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Select the plan you wish to proceed with and click on 'Confirm'</span></li></ul><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155010519287/original/FQ3STx8T5RP98XE_jfQti5y_-bJJYwuRKA4465.png?1697704367\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155010519287\"></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">On confirming, the app amount you opted for will be charged on your card on file and the installation will be successful.<br><br></li><li dir=\"ltr\">Please note that if you don't have a card added at the account level, you won't be able to proceed with the installation. Please visit company billing page, add your card details &amp; retry installing the app.<br><br></li><li dir=\"ltr\">If the app payment needs to be done outside the platform, on clicking 'Allow &amp; Install' during the installation process, you will be redirected to the app provider's pricing and payment page. Select the pricing type and complete the payment. On successful payment, you will be redirected to App Marketplace with the app being in 'Installed' state.&nbsp;</li></ul><p><br></p><h3 id=\"Install-an-app-with-distribution-type-agency-&amp;-subaccount\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Install an app with distribution type agency &amp; subaccount</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\"><br>1. Agency &amp; Subaccount: Such apps are installable at both agency and subaccount levels. <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Installation and uninstallation actions for this distribution type must begin at the agency level.</span></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009862007/original/Zs36Lpr0hqAQsjD0qpoVL5SLPNzElsDsQwedb5.png?1697037852\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155009862007\"></p><p><br><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">2. Distribution type Sub-account: These apps are only available at the sub-account level. Actions related to these apps can only be executed at the sub-account level.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-Uninstall-an-App\"><br><strong>How to Uninstall an App</strong></h2><ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on the App Marketplace option.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Navigate to \u2018Installed Apps\u2019.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Choose the app you wish to disconnect.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Click \u2018Uninstall\u2019 located in the top-right corner.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Confirm the action in the dialog box by selecting Uninstall.<br><br>** Note: Uninstalling an app will also remove any associated plugins/features from the sub-account.<br><br>- Custom conversation providers<br>- Workflow action or triggers</li></ol><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009862696/original/sIs6-8hPeMDH-_USecUkaYvvxXIS1BSMQg5b32.png?1697038032\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155009862696\"></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009862790/original/MAJo_2QInkWASoFGLt7Td8loUnXO1DZhvQ8810.png?1697038100\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155009862790\"></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"&nbsp;\">&nbsp;</h2><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006603-conversation-ai-bot-inactive-sleep-conditions", "title": "Conversation AI - Bot Inactive (Sleep) Conditions", "folder": "Conversation AI", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565038/original/k-mPcbi9HvhF3ZrayhYLqKIGyyIaCwfsrg76b5.jpg?1759968854", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565034/original/dJYDy-QFXjKZXkGemo9DCLU2cCFmQ4scJg76b5.png?1759968854", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565036/original/JcCjM_G_RmA8K7a2oIPwRwFlEbDr05sy_g76b5.jpg?1759968854", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565035/original/T3dcRQ0PQ_d_qbB-dJd_UKU2djTIutZGKw76b5.jpg?1759968854", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565037/original/ibsnq8rel7S5iGJHCJLzjDgG-O3S10R8ng76b5.jpg?1759968854"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">In Conversation AI there are several different events that can put the bot in a conversation \"to sleep\".</p><hr><p></p><p class=\"fd-toc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/155000006567?portalId=48000045315#Bot-Settings\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">Bot Settings</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/155000006567?portalId=48000045315#Bot-Goals\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">Bot Goals</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/155000006567?portalId=48000045315#Conversation\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">Conversation</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/155000006567?portalId=48000045315#Workflow\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">Workflow</a></li></ul><hr><p></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Bot Settings</strong></h2><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Bot Settings &gt; Max Messages -&nbsp;<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">When the total messages in the conversation reaches this limit.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><hr><p></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Bot Goals</strong></h2><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Bot Goals &gt; Stop Bot - When the condition in this goal is reached.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565038/original/k-mPcbi9HvhF3ZrayhYLqKIGyyIaCwfsrg76b5.jpg?1759968854\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; padding: 0px 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-id=\"155055565038\"></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Bot Goals &gt; Appointment Booking &gt; Post Appointment Booked - after an appointment is successfully booked.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565034/original/dJYDy-QFXjKZXkGemo9DCLU2cCFmQ4scJg76b5.png?1759968854\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-id=\"155055565034\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Bot Goals &gt; Human Handover - When the goal is reached and the conversation calls in a human.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Bot Goals &gt; Transfer Bot - When the condition is triggered to switch to a different bot.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565036/original/JcCjM_G_RmA8K7a2oIPwRwFlEbDr05sy_g76b5.jpg?1759968854\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-id=\"155055565036\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></li></ul><hr><p></p><h2 dir=\"