olor: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h1 data-identifyelement=\"462\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-size: 2em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Frequently Asked Questions</strong></h1><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Q. Why should I use Workflow AI?</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Workflow AI makes building and optimizing workflows much faster and easier. It takes out the guesswork by offering real-time suggestions and making sure your workflows are efficient and error-free.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Q. Can Workflow AI handle complex workflows?</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Absolutely! Workflow AI is designed to help with both simple and complex workflows. Whether it\u2019s a one-step process or a multi-layered automation, it\u2019s got your back.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Q. How do I add an action in my workflow?</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Workflow AI will suggest actions based on what you\u2019re building. Just click the <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">+</strong> button next to the action (like sending an SMS or updating a status), and it\u2019ll be added to your workflow.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Q. Can I keep a record of my chat with Workflow AI?</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Yes! Just click on the <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Export Chat</strong> button to download a copy of the conversation, so you can refer to it whenever you need.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Q. Is Workflow AI available for everyone?</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; colo