eos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">In order to use our SMTP server, you need to use the SMTP credentials associated with your domain.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Please note that the SMTP credentials are unique for each domain you add. If you want to check the list of currently added users, or add more users, you can easily do so by accessing your domain settings.</p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#How-to-Create-SMTP-Credentials\">How to Create SMTP Credentials</a><ul><li><a href=\"#%C2%A0SMTP-Settings\">&nbsp;SMTP Settings</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#What-Ports-Does-Mailgun-Support?\">What Ports Does Mailgun Support?</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-Reset-SMTP-Password\">How to Reset SMTP Password</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-Delete-SMTP-Credential\">How to Delete SMTP Credential</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Limits-for-SMTP-and-Emails\">Limits for SMTP and Emails</a></li><li><a href=\"#LC---Email-Pricing\">LC - Email Pricing</a></li></ul><p class=\"fd-toc\"></p><hr><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-Create-SMTP-Credentials\">How to Create SMTP Credentials</h2><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--info\" dir=\"ltr\">SMTP credentials can be created in sub-accounts level(not the agency-assigned domain) not at the agency level.</pre><p><br></p><ol class=\"tdfocus-1669652498763\" data-identifyelement=\"651\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; list-style-type: lower-roman;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1669652756329\" data-identifyelement=\"530\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669648034549\" data-identifyelement=\"652\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">Navigate to <strong dir=\"ltr\">Sub-account Settings - Email Service -&gt; SMTP Service -&gt; Dedicated Domain and IP -&gt; SMTP Settings</strong> under dedicated domain.</span><span class=\"tdfocus-1669648034549\" data-identifyelement=\"652\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023337421/original/nMyZojgr2ZYUAZSkyYnJ6GXwk_Eyr_1HGwc5cd.png?1711087651\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023337421\"></span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1669652774300\" data-identifyelement=\"531\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669648042815\" data-identifyelement=\"659\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">Click the \"Create New SMTP User\" and add username and passwords to create the credential.</span><span class=\"tdfocus-1669648042815\" data-identifyelement=\"659\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023337477/original/3gfn3HeigPBnj1KhpAJrkIlpaoOzAJ0ONw5725.png?1711087786\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023337477\"></span><span class=\"tdfocus-1669648042815\" data-identifyelement=\"659\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023337530/original/utUNsl_XodI8FsMRFgE8TrwwQdmfgvu_uA4506.png?1711087862\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023337530\"></span><br>Please note that only a maximum of five SMTP credentials can be created for a dedicated domain.<br><br></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"&nbsp;SMTP-Settings\">&nbsp;SMTP Settings</h3></li></ol><p><br></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\">SMTP Server Address: smtp.mailgun.org\nSecure Connection: TLS/SSL based on your mail client/website SMTP plugin SMTP Username: [YourGivenName@DomainName.com]\nSMTP Password: [YourGivenPassword]\nSMTP port: <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">25, 465 (SSL/TLS), 587 (STARTTLS), and 2525.</span></pre><p><br></p><hr><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-Ports-Does-Mailgun-Support?\">What Ports Does Mailgun Support?</h2><p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;<br>Our servers listen on ports 25, 465 (SSL/TLS), 587 (STARTTLS), and 2525.</p><hr><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-Reset-SMTP-Password\">How to Reset SMTP Password</h2><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To finalize the password reset process, kindly click on the \"Reset Password\" button located in the pop-up modal.</span></p><p><span class=\"tdfocus-1669652779878\" data-identifyelement=\"663\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023337656/original/22ZqznlGSww3OYVk2ULdCYph_uhwvbBG9A16b5.png?1711088188\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023337656\"></span></p><p><span class=\"tdfocus-1669652779878\" data-identifyelement=\"663\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023337668/original/NsTvuvM2YMJRI2xkQypolDdneD_Yn8-tJw58fa.png?1711088202\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023337668\"></span></p><p><span class=\"tdfocus-1669652779878\" data-identifyelement=\"663\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><hr><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-Delete-SMTP-Credential\">How to Delete SMTP Credential</h2><p><br></p><p><span class=\"tdfocus-1669652779878\" data-identifyelement=\"663\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">To Delete the SMTP credential, kindly click on the \"Delete\" button located in the pop-up modal.</span></span></p><p><span class=\"tdfocus-1669652779878\" data-identifyelement=\"663\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023337727/original/f7oeVWxByu7aA60MK7YoTBAA7c-citPWbg8724.png?1711088371\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023337727\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669652779878\" data-identifyelement=\"663\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023337732/original/-c2VpTSwanpwk3Nc_sLI3fi87590WKS2TAb582.png?1711088383\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023337732\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><hr><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Limits-for-SMTP-and-Emails\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Limits for SMTP and Emails</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">SMTP Limit:</strong></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">A maximum of <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">five SMTP credentials</strong> can be created for each dedicated domain.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Daily Email Limit:</strong></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Each account has a limit of <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">1,500 emails per day</strong>.</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">If the daily limit is exceeded, <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">SMTP credentials will be automatically deleted</strong> from all dedicated domains.</li></ul><hr><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1664984268769\" data-identifyelement=\"623\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"LC---Email-Pricing\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"626\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">LC - Email Pricing</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1666104345186\" data-identifyelement=\"627\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">the <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">All incoming and outgoing emails (To, CC, and BCC) will be charged at same email sending price.</span></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004089-bot-status-for-individual-contacts", "title": "Bot Status for Individual Contacts", "folder": "Conversation AI", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035422593/original/RY-xbsAWIUbzGDZdqlyQwngug02JPUR3wwf04a.png?1729864262", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035422644/original/wZj4ebDGBWM3IlIK8sglNJ4pgCFj2sTtvwc0a4.png?1729864286", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035422714/original/v-3vxkIlhVK75Ziae_FeVlaXsinhJi810A54db.png?1729864339", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035422771/original/aqc8B95oM0SYltbIndnztZzPeo6IH-rhKAe9fe.png?1729864370", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035430856/original/rOlfJAzypInuXDj3PcdIYw9ULfZiriK8XQdfae.png?1729870103"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#Introduction\">Introduction</a></li><li><a href=\"#Key-Features\">Key Features</a></li><li><a href=\"#Where-to-Access-Bot-Status%C2%A0\">Where to Access Bot Status&nbsp;</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-Turn-Off-Bot-for-a-Specific-Contact\">How to Turn Off Bot for a Specific Contact</a></li><li><a href=\"#Additional-Information%C2%A0\">Additional Information&nbsp;</a></li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Introduction\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Introduction</span></strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\">The <strong>Bot Status for Individual Contacts</strong> feature gives users enhanced control over when the AI bot interacts with specific contacts. From the message composer, users can easily monitor and set the bot active or inactive for each contact. This feature allows users to turn the bot on or off for individual contacts based on specific needs, ensuring a more personalized and flexible interaction.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 class=\"p-rich_text_section\" id=\"Key-Features\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><b data-stringify-type=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Key Features</span></b></h2><ol class=\"p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__ordered p-rich_text_list--nested\" data-border=\"0\" data-indent=\"0\" data-list-tree=\"true\" data-stringify-type=\"ordered-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: decimal; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-stringify-border=\"0\" data-stringify-indent=\"0\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px; list-style-type: unset; margin-inline-start: 20px; padding-inline-start: 8px;\"><b data-stringify-type=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Improved Bot Control:</b> You can now manually adjust the bot's status for each contact</li><li data-stringify-border=\"0\" data-stringify-indent=\"0\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px; list-style-type: unset; margin-inline-start: 20px; padding-inline-start: 8px;\"><b data-stringify-type=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Active:</b> The bot will respond to all incoming messages.</li><li data-stringify-border=\"0\" data-stringify-indent=\"0\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px; list-style-type: unset; margin-inline-start: 20px; padding-inline-start: 8px;\"><b data-stringify-type=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Sleep/Snooze:</b> The bot is temporarily paused, either manually or due to certain actions (e.g., when a manual or workflow message is sent, or message limits are reached).</li><li data-stringify-border=\"0\" data-stringify-indent=\"0\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px; list-style-type: unset; margin-inline-start: 20px; padding-inline-start: 8px;\"><b data-stringify-type=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Inactive:</b> The bot remains off until manually reactivated.</li><li data-stringify-border=\"0\" data-stringify-indent=\"0\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px; list-style-type: unset; margin-inline-start: 20px; padding-inline-start: 8px;\"><b data-stringify-type=\"bold\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Sleep Timer:&nbsp;</b>Users can set a specific time for the bot to automatically wake up and start responding again.</li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 id=\"Where-to-Access-Bot-Status&nbsp;\"><strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Where to Access Bot Status&nbsp;</span></strong></h2><ul><li>Go to the <strong>Conversations</strong> tab.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">In the <strong>Message Composer</strong> section for any contact, you will see the bot\u2019s current status, indicated by a green online icon (if active).</li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035422593/original/RY-xbsAWIUbzGDZdqlyQwngug02JPUR3wwf04a.png?1729864262\" style=\"width: 619px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155035422593\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035422644/original/wZj4ebDGBWM3IlIK8sglNJ4pgCFj2sTtvwc0a4.png?1729864286\" style=\"width: 617px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155035422644\"></p><h4 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\"><br></h4><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-Turn-Off-Bot-for-a-Specific-Contact\"><strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">How to Turn Off Bot for a Specific Contact</span></strong></h2><ul><li>To disable the bot for a particular contact, click on the icon and select <strong>Inactive</strong> from the dropdown.</li><li>You can also set a specific duration after which the bot will automatically turn back on.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">If you want the bot to remain permanently off for that contact, simply uncheck the checkbox.</li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035422714/original/v-3vxkIlhVK75Ziae_FeVlaXsinhJi810A54db.png?1729864339\" style=\"width: 618px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155035422714\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\">The bot will now be turned off for the selected contact, as indicated by the change in the status icon.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035422771/original/aqc8B95oM0SYltbIndnztZzPeo6IH-rhKAe9fe.png?1729864370\" style=\"width: 621px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155035422771\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Additional-Information&nbsp;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Additional Information</span></strong>&nbsp;</h2><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\">This feature is only available when the bot is in <strong>Suggestive</strong> or <strong>Auto-Pilot</strong> mode.</pre><p dir=\"ltr\">In following scenarios, the bot will automatically turn off for a contact, such as when the maximum message limit is reached or when a manual/workflow message is triggered.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035430856/original/rOlfJAzypInuXDj3PcdIYw9ULfZiriK8XQdfae.png?1729870103\" style=\"width: 628px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035430856\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">By using the <strong>Bot Status for Individual Contacts</strong> feature, users can fine-tune their bot\u2019s interaction on a contact level, ensuring that the bot only engages with the appropriate contact of their choice</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004534-shipping-and-delivery-rates-for-ecommerce-stores", "title": "Shipping and Delivery rates for Ecommerce Stores", "folder": "Ecommerce", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546782/original/NQK2L5mRq7tp3dUL5TLHRLck5J4Rz2ppEQb6db.jpg?1738039514", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546776/original/am8vH0X6rFYTM543MtkjU22l0V-6SvlauQe8f6.jpg?1738039512", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546778/original/I8Tbz2JeSbFezOXxZgt9N-iJ4h1asg0vbA2b63.jpg?1738039513", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546780/original/-DPO3rylX3PSSiqJmqVFihELTtWZyMgXvA2b63.jpg?1738039513", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546779/original/Vc9StBbx5iGt-pxPkVg1GU_bNdarp2oRiA2b63.jpg?1738039513", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546781/original/xAFBLV7tkAz8gTNK8pN-zM6iATg_uCSNWwb6db.jpg?1738039514", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546783/original/ko6lawhkIhUhqNtQYSfnYNZA3KRoGc2WmQ7204.jpg?1738039516", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546777/original/1JXjYYV64AvMdm4E93Sp3CSj1wTcpnNGSg2b63.png?1738039513"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#About%3A\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#Setting-up-shipping-zones%3A\">Setting up shipping zones:</a><ul><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Steps-to-Create-a-Shipping-Zone%3A\">Steps to Create a Shipping Zone</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Setup-conditional-Pricing-on-Shipping-rates%3A\">Setup conditional Pricing on Shipping rates:</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Example-Setup-based-on-product-weight-range%3A\">Example Setup based on product weight range:</a></li><li><a href=\"#Example-Setup-based-on-total-order-amount%3A\">Example Setup based on total order amount:</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Steps%3A\">Steps</a></li></ul></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#notes:\">Notes</a></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"About:\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">About:</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">We have introduced the functionality that enable e-commerce store owners to define manual delivery charges based on various criteria, such as shipping zones, states/provinces, and product weights. This document serves as a guide to help store owners set up and manage these shipping and delivery rates effectively.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Setting-up-shipping-zones:\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Setting up shipping zones:</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Shipping zones allow store owners to create specific regions with customised delivery charges. Store owners can define the delivery charges for selected states/provinces within a country.</p><h4 id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></h4><h4 id=\"Steps-to-Create-a-Shipping-Zone:\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Steps to Create a Shipping Zone:</h4><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Navigate to <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Sub-Account &gt; Payments &gt; Settings &gt; Shipping &amp; Delivery</strong>.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Click on <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Add Zone</strong>.</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Select the desired countries to include in the zone. Select specific states/provinces within a country that are required in the created zone.</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Click on <strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Add Rate</strong> to define manual rates for the zone. Here, users can define shipping rates and also add a conditional pricing.</li></ol><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546782/original/NQK2L5mRq7tp3dUL5TLHRLck5J4Rz2ppEQb6db.jpg?1738039514\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155040546782\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: po